      "source": [
        "# 🧬 Creating GuacaMol Vocabularies for MolE\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook demonstrates how to create vocabulary files from the GuacaMol dataset for different Morgan fingerprint settings.\n",
        "\n",
        "## What we'll create:\n",
        "- **6 vocabulary files** total:\n",
        "  - 3 radii (0, 1, 2) × 2 environment types (structural, functional)\n",
        "- **Structural environments** (`useFeatures=False`): Based on connectivity\n",
        "- **Functional environments** (`useFeatures=True`): Based on pharmacophore features\n",
        "\n",
        "## Files that will be generated:\n",
        "1. `vocabulary_radius0_structural_guacamol_v1.pkl`\n",
        "2. `vocabulary_radius0_functional_guacamol_v1.pkl`\n",
        "3. `vocabulary_radius1_structural_guacamol_v1.pkl`\n",
        "4. `vocabulary_radius1_functional_guacamol_v1.pkl`\n",
        "5. `vocabulary_radius2_structural_guacamol_v1.pkl`\n",
        "6. `vocabulary_radius2_functional_guacamol_v1.pkl`\n"
      ]
    }
  ],
